MASTER AESTHETIC & SYSTEM RULES FOR TUI_OS (BURNED BOX):
This is NOT a dashboard. It is one continuous typographic OS field. No cards, no rounded corners, no soft shadows, no section billboards, no DateBlocks, no stacked day lists, no teal decorative watermarks.

PALETTE: Canvas #F4F4F0 · Ink #111 · Cobalt #0000FF · Urgent #FF2B2B. Cobalt is the primary chrome color (Fidèle / S4AD). Red is ONLY for strikes + URGENT + [X].

TYPE: JetBrains Mono for ALL chrome, nests, prompts, logs, metadata. Space Grotesk ONLY for calendar numerals. No Inter.

COMPOSITION:
1. Sticky teletext HUD — micro VAULT mark + LOCAL/SYNC/clock + mode chips + INVERT. Not a hero logo.
2. True Cram Grid calendar — Day 1 top-left, wrap continuously, no weekday offset. No month watermark blobs. Day labels = cobalt on white. Selected numeral = cobalt. Logged days = red mid-strike OVER the day label. Selected logs = white/cobalt chips that OVERLAY neighboring cells (parasite stack).
3. Headerless Hybrid Nest — no "TASKS" monument. Root underline → L1 dashed+`-` → L2+ `\` on own line. Mobile: break-words min-w-0.
4. Headerless Scratch Dump — cobalt date anchors, hairline rules, raw list. No green terminal.
5. ONE sticky Prompt Dock — single `>` line. Context switches: DAY (sys log) / NEST (root or child) / DUMP (scratch). Never three separate forms.

HARD VETO: DateBlocks, jagged day cards, SaaS section stacks, acid teal watermarks, giant centered logos eating the viewport, green-on-black notes.
